---
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
const breadcrumbs=[{name:'Home',path:'/'},{name:'Privacy',path:'/privacy/'}];
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs} title="Privacy — Salmon Joy" description="How this website handles enquiry details, external links, and your animation preference.">
 <article class="privacy-body"><Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs}/><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CLARITY</span><h1>Your details.<br/><em>Your choice.</em></h1><p>This website is a personal portfolio and training enquiry guide. There is no account system, enquiry database, live AI service, or site analytics script.</p><h2>Enquiries stay in your browser</h2><p>The workshop finder and enquiry builder prepare a message on your device. Your name, organization, team size, and learning goal are not submitted to a website backend or saved by the site. Reloading or leaving the page clears those entries, though your browser may offer its own form autofill.</p><h2>You choose when to send</h2><p>Email and WhatsApp links open a prepared message in the application you choose. Nothing is sent automatically. The respective provider’s privacy terms apply when you open or send a message. The site cannot verify delivery.</p><h2>A small motion preference</h2><p>The site uses local storage to remember whether you have turned animations on or off. You can change this using the motion control at the top of the page. No enquiry information is placed in local storage.</p><h2>External content and hosting</h2><p>LinkedIn, YouTube, GitHub, credential links, and contact applications are external services. They may collect information according to their own policies when you visit. Images and fonts are served with this website. The hosting provider may process standard connection and security information, such as IP addresses and request logs, to deliver the site.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Contact <a href="mailto:salmonjoy1996@gmail.com">salmonjoy1996@gmail.com</a> with any questions about this website.</p></article>
</Layout>
